  "measurementNotes": [
    "Layer FPS summaries are duration-weighted whole approximately one-second bins at least 100 ms inside phase signposts, not frame-time percentiles or physical display scanout.",
    "The per-frame interval table is empty. Duration counter summary exports are retained raw; no unsupported per-frame percentile or absolute no-hitch claim is made.",
    "Final driver executes input directly in a main-thread CADisplayLink callback requesting60Hz. bufferingNewest(1) stream handles only phase completion/cancellation, no input queue or catch-up. missed is 600 minus consumed callbacks, floored at zero. Earlier timer stress results are retained separately. Intermediate trials and historical baseline ran alongside prior task demo renderers; final captures run after stopping those four known task-owned demo processes. These are not matched before/after timing deltas.",
    "CPU geometry and resource update measurements are not GPU frame times. CPU sample weights are inclusive statistics, not elapsed wall time, and cannot be summed across nested functions.",
    "Visibility and coherence are record/input snapshots, not percentages of rendered frames. panPresentations counts complete ground frames in pan and zoom; meshUploads counts unique GPU buffer updates, not texture uploads.",
    "No builds or benchmarks ran during captures. Ordinary apps remained running. Short programmatic-intent runs do not verify physical gestures, thermal soak, or long-run memory stability.",
    "Physical iPhone excluded by user. iPad simulator diagnostics do not verify hardware FPS."
